// The fee accounting of a shielded swap: an input is split into a recipient amount, a
// change amount, and a protocol fee, and the circuit checks the three sum back to the
// input. A verifier confirms the split is exact without seeing any of the three values.
// Run: zkolang shield/fee_split.zkl
input total;
input recipient;
input change;
input fee;
assert total - (recipient + change + fee);
output recipient;
